         ros-jazzy-serial
Description: Nooploop NLink parser for ROS 2 (LinkTrack / LinkTrack AoA)
 ROS 2 port of the Nooploop nlink_parser, providing linktrack,
 linktrack_aoa and visualization nodes plus custom message interfaces.
 Depends on the standalone ros-jazzy-serial package and installs under
 the configured install prefix (default /opt/roboparty) for the RoboParty
 UWB positioning integration.
